# Testing Skill

Reference with **@claude-skills/testing** when writing or updating tests.

## When to use

- User asks for tests, unit tests, or integration tests
- Adding tests for new or changed behavior
- Fixing or extending existing test suites

## Principles

- **Unit tests:** Use mocks for external deps; keep tests fast and isolated
- **Integration tests:** Use live services per project rules (ENV=test, check_services)
- Place unit tests in `tests/unit/`, integration in `tests/integration` (or project equivalent)
- Prefer pytest for Python; follow project patterns (fixtures, parametrize)
- Run full unit suite before suggesting completion; ensure no redundant or obsolete tests
